<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lindum Q4 profits drop, gold output flat.</title>
<headline>Lindum Q4 profits drop, gold output flat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec 31 versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital</p>
<p>    expenditure		     1.27  vs   1.95</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure	   0.63  vs   1.23</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		    218  vs   196</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		 379  vs   383</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		   1.74 vs   1.95</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		  52.36 vs  50.81</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	     55.92 vs  55.22</p>
<p>Full name: Lindum Reefs Gold Mining Company Ltd (mining producers - gold - rand &amp; others)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
